'''''Ixia polystachya''''', the '''white-and-yellow-flower cornlily''',<ref>{{PLANTS|id=IXPO|taxon=Ixia polystachya|accessdate=26 May 2015}}</ref> is an ''[[Ixia]]'' species found on hills and slopes of northwest and southwest Cape, South Africa.<ref name=Tropicos>{{cite web |url=http://www.tropicos.org/Name/16601248|title=''Ixia polystachya'' L. |website=Tropicos |accessdate=27 April 2018}}</ref>

